  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this activity will be to close the gaps to HIV epidemic control; sustain health gains through strengthened, improved, and resilient health systems; and leverage community, civil society, and private sector partnerships to improve and sustain service delivery and client outcomes in Limpopo Province.</narrative>
